  "description": "EGEZEW crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P 21 21 2. Reported CIF formula moiety: C84 H94 N50 O38 Yb4 4+,8(Br1 1-),4(H3 O1 1+),35(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Yb1 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2 (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb1A (Yb) has 8 O neighbors; Yb2A (Yb) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.585-3.705 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 89.71-108.91°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula (H3O)4[Yb4(OH)6(H2O)4(IN@CB[6])2]Br8·35H2O. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
